:54:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.908554196357727,"text_excerpt":"I've never given a Walmart such a high rating, but they have some insane deals here! Probably the most affordable produce in the city. Bunches of collards and radishes for $1. Ripe mangoes for 48 cents! Tomatoes for 98 cents a lb. Bread for $1. Mini pies for 50 cents. I loaded four shopping bags for $23, and left happy. Parts of the neighborhood are kinda rough. I'd go during the day, especially if walking."},{"business_id":"7JhQXpiMml41sxN34CUcKQ","review_id":"hpq0VxTgT0iOUxDFtl8ReA","date":"2015-03-31T16:52:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.903781533241272,"text_excerpt":"I don't really review superstores that often, so maybe my star rating is a bit more robust than others here... I like this Wal-Mart. The people are really friendly, helpful and usually pretty knowledgable about what they have in stock. I have never seen a child with a firearm. Never really heard anyone swear. I do, however, usually come here around 6am when I am done at my gym down the way. The bathrooms here are always clean. At htis particular branch they are constantly updating prices....the other day I bought a bunch of belly button rings for $1 a piece. BAM!"},{"business_id":"7JhQXpiMml41sxN34CUcKQ","review_id":"KGFbaMMgV1w-nxUcilo0TQ","date":"2016-02-28T12:42:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8976706862449646,"text_excerpt":"I don't understand all the hate on WalMart. I love WalMart! It always has exactly what I need, and even more of what I didn't know I needed! This WalMart is my go-to place for deals on the essentials like meat, Greek yogurt, fresh vegetables, fruit, cliff bars, and spaghetti. Also, they have a large selection of beer, wine, and liquor that's way cheaper than at a liquor store for the same exact thing! What's more, is that WalMart has things for everyone, even gifts for your nieces, nephews, and grandparents! It also has a large pet center, where you can buy food, treats, and kitty litter on a bargain. Plus, there's still the WalMart app, which has the \"savings catcher\" feature, so you can..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7JhQXpiMml41sxN34CUcKQ","photo_id":"93vgdxYihFjXRK_ALicjgA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/93vgdxYihFjXRK_ALicjgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8384641408920288},{"business_id":"7JhQXpiMml41sxN34CUcKQ","photo_id":"F3U1EUfi7Vsg0GBwkvglzA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/F3U1EUfi7Vsg0GBwkvglzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.838464081287384}]},"notebook_case":null}
